A rocky '''jungle outpost''' was located on<ref name="SoloEE" /> the [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]]<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|numidian-prime|Numidian Prime}}</ref> [[planet]] [[Numidian Prime]]. It was hidden in the [[jungle]]s of the planet,<ref name="SoloEE" /> a [[Forest|rainforest]] paradise that served as a haven for [[smuggler]]s and [[Thief|thieves]] seeking to evade outstanding debts.<ref name="Databank" /> With a [[Cantina|bar]] as well as a [[gambling]] area with a [[sabacc]] table, the outpost's entrance was guarded, making it a difficult place to gain access to.<ref name="SoloEE" />

The [[human]] [[Landonis Balthazar Calrissian|Lando Calrissian]] visited the jungle outpost<ref name="Solo">''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story]]''</ref> soon after<ref name="Lando DB">{{Databank|lando-calrissian|Lando Calrissian}}</ref> [[Showdown on Savareen|leaving]] [[Savareen]] aboard a battered ''[[Millennium Falcon]]'', his personal [[YT-1300 light freighter]]. However, Calrissian was tracked down by the human [[Han Solo]] and<ref name="Solo" /> the faithful [[Wookiee]] [[Chewbacca]].<ref name="Databank" />

Solo sat down with Calrissian in a game of sabacc,<ref name="Solo" /> famously winning the ''Millennium Falcon'' in the process.<ref name="Databank" /> Solo then sauntered off with his Wookiee [[Pilot|co-pilot]],<ref name="Solo" /> becoming smugglers after taking the ''Falcon'' to [[Tatooine]] in pursuit of a lead from<ref name="Databank" /> Solo's mentor, [[Tobias Beckett]], about a big-shot [[Jabba Desilijic Tiure|gangster]] putting together a crew.<ref name="Solo" />

